{
  "enabled": true,
  "name": "Reflect After Task",
  "description": "After completing a spec task, reflect on what was learned, what was new or surprising, and whether any documentation, steering, or hooks should be updated with general-purpose improvements.",
  "version": "1",
  "when": {
    "type": "postTaskExecution"
  },
  "then": {
    "type": "askAgent",
    "prompt": "Now that this task is complete, reflect on the work you just did:\n\n1. **What was new or surprising?** Did you encounter any constraints, behaviors, or patterns that were not covered in the documentation?\n2. **What was incorrect?** Did any documentation or steering advice turn out to be wrong or misleading?\n3. **What general lessons were learned?** Think about patterns that would apply to ANY future container build, not just this specific one.\n\nIf you identified general improvements, update the following files:\n- `.kiro/steering/lessons-learned.md` — Append new lessons under a dated section\n- `docs/` files — Fix any inaccuracies or add missing information\n- `.kiro/steering/container-building.md` — Update the workflow if the process should change\n\nIMPORTANT: Only include general-purpose improvements. Do NOT add anything specific to the container you just built."
  }
}